  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"471\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"185\">About our brand and products</strong><br data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"188\">Ecomarket.com is Europe’s destination for sustainable, ethical, and vegan fashion. We carefully curate independent brands that respect people, animals, and the planet — from organic cotton essentials and recycled activewear to PETA-approved vegan sneakers and timeless accessories.</p><p data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"804\"><strong data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"502\">What makes us different</strong><br data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"505\">Unlike typical online fashion stores, every product we offer is fully vetted for transparency, certifications, and impact. We say no to greenwashing and yes to style that matters. Our platform is multilingual (English, Italian, Spanish) and designed for conscious shoppers who demand authenticity.</p><p data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"1098\"><strong data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"836\">How affiliates can earn</strong><br data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"839\">Earn <strong data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"862\">10% commission</strong> on every valid sale with a generous <strong data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"923\">45-day cookie window</strong>. We also run seasonal bonuses and contests to reward top partners. Payouts are monthly via PayPal or bank transfer, with fair thresholds that respect creators of all sizes.</p><p data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1401\"><strong data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1124\">How to promote us</strong><br data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1127\">You can leverage our ready-to-use media assets, logos, and campaign visuals — or craft your own authentic stories around sustainable living. Share with your audience via Instagram, TikTok, blogs, YouTube, or newsletters, knowing you are aligned with values-driven fashion.</p><p data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1738\"><strong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1427\">Other information</strong><br data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1430\">We believe in partnerships, not transactions. Affiliates get access to new product launches, seasonal campaigns, and personal support. By joining Ecomarket, you’re not just promoting fashion — you’re helping transform the industry into something better. Together, we make every sale a statement for change.</p></div></div>",
